  "static_findings": [
    "Pending capacity 128 -> 1024; only two full snapshots moved to heap, outside spinlocks, with normal-return pfree",
    "Shmem size derives from sizeof(DtxPendingCtl); complete restart required when eventually deployed",
    "Probe uses transaction-local pgstat counts; falls back for disabled/changed GUC, disabled relation stats or truncate/drop; native decision logic preserved",
    "Internal Citus connections qualify via actual writes instead of application_name exclusion",
    "GC executes on every node each recovery invocation; at most 5000 candidate rows per round",
    "GC excludes current transaction/subtransaction xids and unmapped groups; checks Citus primaries, Raft peers and self",
    "Any failed/incomplete node observation or recovery-mode node prevents deletion",
    "Deletion uses gid, groupid and original xmin; matching PREPARED candidates retained",
    "GC remains synchronous; bounded candidate count is not a hard RPC latency bound",
    "Known isolated route 4097 issue K1 remains unresolved"
